    - @subpage xmlsoapguide -- SOAP and WSDL web services: supported standards and choosing a module
    - @subpage xmlwebdavguide -- WebDAV servers and clients, and RFC 4918 compliance
    - @subpage xmlusermodules -- the user modules delivered with the xml module
    - @subpage xmlcookbook -- complete examples for common tasks
    - @subpage xmlapioverview -- classes, functions, constants and module options
    - @subpage xmlreleasenotes -- version history

